<title>UK: Buyers sidelined on unchanged UK meals market.</title>
<headline>Buyers sidelined on unchanged UK meals market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unchanged prices failed to attracted buyers to the UK meals and feeds market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;People have been willing to go lower than their published prices just to get business going, but there have been no takers,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal ex-mill and east coast store was unchanged with the stronger dollar wiping out any benefit from the lower Chicago close on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
